sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% 參與者分層定義
    actor Client as 系統端 (Client)
    participant Member as 成員 (Member: 1)
    
    box rgb(240, 248, 255) 社群頻道領域 (Subject)
        participant ChatRoom as 聊天室 (ChatRoom)
    end

    box rgb(255, 250, 240) 機器人框架層 (Facade & Observer)
        participant Bot as 社群機器人 (Bot Facade)
        participant KingCmd as KingCommand (Command)
    end

    box rgb(245, 255, 250) 有限狀態機模組 (Composite State Pattern)
        participant RootFSM as 根狀態機 (Root FSM)
        participant NormalState as 正常複合狀態 (Normal CompositeState)
        participant DefaultSubState as 預設對話子狀態 (DefaultConversation)
        participant Trans as Transition (策略判斷)
        participant Guard as QuotaRoleGuard (Strategy)
        participant KingState as 知識王複合狀態 (KnowledgeKing)
        participant QSubState as 出題子狀態 (Questioning)
    end

    box rgb(255, 240, 245) 領域模型實體
        participant Game as 知識王競賽 (KnowledgeKingGame)
    end

    Note over Client, Game: 【場景】當前狀態：Normal (DefaultConversation)；管理員發送 "king @bot" 訊息

    %% 1. 成員發言
    Client->>Member: sendMessage(chatRoom, "king", ["bot"])
    Member->>ChatRoom: postMessage(Message("king", tags=["bot"]))
    Note over ChatRoom: 終端印出: 💬 1: king @bot

    %% 2. 觀察者推播通知 Bot
    ChatRoom->>Bot: notifyMessage(message)
    Note over Bot, ChatRoom: [觀察者模式] 頻道解耦推播事件給 Bot

    %% 3. Bot 門面委派事件至當前狀態機
    Bot->>RootFSM: handleEvent(MessageEvent(message))
    RootFSM->>NormalState: handleEvent(MessageEvent)
    NormalState->>DefaultSubState: handleEvent(MessageEvent)
    Note over RootFSM, DefaultSubState: [複合模式] 狀態機與狀態一致介面，階層委派事件

    %% 4. 當前狀態先做訊息輪播回覆
    DefaultSubState->>Bot: replyCurrentCycle(message)
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(Message("good to hear", tags=["1"]))
    Note over ChatRoom: 終端印出: 🤖: good to hear @1

    %% 5. 指令模式解析與驗證 (Command + Guard Strategy)
    Bot->>KingCmd: execute(context)
    KingCmd->>Guard: evaluate(context)
    Note over Guard: [策略模式] 檢查 author.isAdmin == true 且 community.quota >= 5
    Guard-->>KingCmd: true (驗證通過)

    %% 6. 扣除 Quota 與觸發狀態轉移
    KingCmd->>Bot: decreaseQuota(5)
    KingCmd->>RootFSM: fireTrigger("kingTrigger")

    %% 7. 狀態機轉移生命週期 (Exit -> Transition Action -> Entry)
    RootFSM->>Trans: transit(from=Normal, to=KnowledgeKing)
    Trans->>NormalState: exit()
    NormalState->>DefaultSubState: exit()
    
    %% 轉移動作：初始化遊戲
    Trans->>Game: start(QuestionBank)
    
    Trans->>KingState: enter()
    KingState->>QSubState: enter()
    
    %% 8. 進入出題狀態之 Entry Action
    QSubState->>Bot: onEnter()
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(Message("KnowledgeKing is started!"))
    Note over ChatRoom: 終端印出: 🤖: KnowledgeKing is started!

    Bot->>Game: getCurrentQuestion()
    Game-->>Bot: Question(0, "請問哪個 SQL 語句用於選擇所有的行？", options=[...])
    Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(Message("0. 請問哪個 SQL 語句用於選擇所有的行？\nA) SELECT *\n..."))
    Note over ChatRoom: 終端印出考題 Q0 內容與選項
